cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ATTESTATION-v1 or the reference verifiers, please cite this
  repository and credit Aqta Technologies Ltd (CC-BY-4.0 for the spec;
  Apache-2.0 for the code).
type: software
title: "Seal record formats (ATTESTATION-v1, ACTION-v1) and reference verifiers"
abstract: >-
  Open specification and two separately written reference verifiers
  (TypeScript and Python) for Ed25519-signed records of AI decisions:
  ATTESTATION-v1 for model calls and ACTION-v1 for agent actions, with
  draft GRANT-v1 and USE-v1 profiles. Offline-verifiable against a
  published public key without trusting the issuer's servers.
